    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Culinary Empire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Tasty Business</strong>, a management game where you turn small diners into world-class restaurants! As an ambitious investor, your goal is to buy, upgrade, and expand various food businesses, creating a mouth-watering empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to grow:<br>\ud83c\udf54 <strong>Upgrade your restaurants</strong> \u2013 Expand menus, optimize operations, and attract more customers!<br>\ud83c\udfea <strong>Buy new establishments</strong> \u2013 Invest in the food industry and dominate the culinary scene.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Profit and reinvest</strong> \u2013 Manage your earnings to keep expanding your business.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Engage with the world</strong> \u2013 Meet unique characters and uncover secrets that can boost your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a simple diner into a million-dollar restaurant chain? The fate of your culinary empire is in your hands!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230210/extras/cf893b9bdfeed2b8a06a7b329279c100.poster.avif?t=1740146074\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230210/extras/cf893b9bdfeed2b8a06a7b329279c100.webm?t=1740146074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Culinary Empire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Tasty Business</strong>, a management game where you turn small diners into world-class restaurants! As an ambitious investor, your goal is to buy, upgrade, and expand various food businesses, creating a mouth-watering empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to grow:<br>\ud83c\udf54 <strong>Upgrade your restaurants</strong> \u2013 Expand menus, optimize operations, and attract more customers!<br>\ud83c\udfea <strong>Buy new establishments</strong> \u2013 Invest in the food industry and dominate the culinary scene.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Profit and reinvest</strong> \u2013 Manage your earnings to keep expanding your business.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Engage with the world</strong> \u2013 Meet unique characters and uncover secrets that can boost your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a simple diner into a million-dollar restaurant chain? The fate of your culinary empire is in your hands!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230210/extras/cf893b9bdfeed2b8a06a7b329279c100.poster.avif?t=1740146074\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230210/extras/cf893b9bdfeed2b8a06a7b329279c100.webm?t=1740146074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
